Package: surveymetrics
Type: Package
Title: Automated Cleaning, Parametric Inference, and Burnout Indexing for Academic Surveys
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jubaraj", "Bag", , "jubarajbag26-max@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a standardized pipeline for quantitative social science researchers 
    to sanitize raw Google Forms CSV exports, compute parametric confidence intervals, 
    execute Welch's two-sample t-tests across categorical cohorts, and standardize 
    composite behavioral and burnout indices.
URL: https://github.com/jubarajbag26-max/surveymetrics
